# VHS M2: a camera without MJPEG: Space takes no photo and says why (brief section 20; the wording is provisional).
title VHS M2: no photo from a YUYV-only camera
sizes 480x320
ppmm 608
env VHS_FAKE yuyv
env VHS_FORMAT rgb565
env VHS_CLOCK_SYNCED 0

wait 1500
key space
wait 400
shot 01-refused
expect text "Photos need a camera that sends MJPEG."
key esc
expect quit
